    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "Our kitchen was orange. Not a fun orange. A tired, eighties,",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 293.98
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "knotty-pine orange, with a drawer that came out in your hand",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 306.97
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "and an oven door you had to hold shut with your hip. We said we",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 318.98
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 245.1,
     "text": "would do something about it every January for six years.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 280.07
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 267.6,
     "text": "This January we did. Six weeks, the contractor said. He was",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 295.51
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "right, which nobody believed at the time.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 204.57
    }
   ],
