    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
     "y": 128.2,
     "text": "The first pancakes",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 271.69,
     "tracking": -0.5
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "Six weeks to the day, the contractor put on the last handle, ran",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 308.19
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "the faucet for us like a magician, and left. We stood in the",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 283.28
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "doorway for a bit, not quite sure we were allowed in.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 259.08
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 252.6,
     "text": "Then Ivy asked for pancakes, and that settled it. Tom made the",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 310.86
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 267.6,
     "text": "first batch on the new stove. The first one stuck, as the first one",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 314.09
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "always does. Nobody minded. We ate standing up around the",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 300.57
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 297.6,
     "text": "island because we had not bought the stools yet, and it was the",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 308.02
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 312.6,
     "text": "best breakfast we have had in that house.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 203.63
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 205,
     "y": 335.1,
     "text": "The drawer still works. We check most days.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 219.78
    }
   ],
